NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENSE: the contents of `data/`.

The bar files under `data/` are derived from licensed intraday market data and
are anonymized by ticker relabelling. They are included so the model runs out of
the box, and are NOT redistributable as a dataset. No right to redistribute them
is granted here, because none is held to grant. See `data/README.md`.

The MIT grant above applies to the software: `src/`, `app/`, `tests/`,
`backtest/`, and the build and launch scripts.
